00:32:43,772 --> 00:32:47,652
So we need an engagement with our community, but we also

550
00:32:47,712 --> 00:32:51,472
need continuously trained users of our community, because

551
00:32:51,572 --> 00:32:54,612
otherwise it's just an empty

