3128
03:33:38,228 --> 03:33:39,048
We were interested in

3129
03:33:40,748 --> 03:33:44,488
quantifying for how many names this

3130
03:33:45,028 --> 03:33:46,868
transitivity property fails.

3131
03:33:48,948 --> 03:33:52,928
So we did some analysis of the World Checklist of Vascular Plants and World Flora

3132
03:33:53,008 --> 03:33:53,428
Online.

3133
03:33:54,868 --> 03:33:58,748
